
Prepare the Jenkins EC2 instance:

Step 1.1 — Check the existing installation

java -version
mvn -version
docker --version
sudo systemctl status jenkins

Step 1.2 — Install Java 21 and Maven

sudo dnf update -y
sudo dnf install -y java-21-amazon-corretto-devel maven git curl


java -version
